   {
    "title": "Chaotica, Virtual Call Center",
    "description": "Chaotica is a suite of software developed to create new learning opportunities within the call center workplace. Our mission is to simulate real-life experiences so that you select the proper team to fit your business needs. \n\nWith Chaotica, measure level of empathy, sympathy, and a wide range of client metrics. \nUsing voice-driven AI and Cortana, simulate a phone call to assess customer service skill.\nLaunch the service and respond to artificial intelligence in the same manner you would on a live call. Chaotica assesses skill based on targeted keywords and call-flow schema. A score is generated based on how efficiently an issue is handled. ",
    "dateRange": {},
    "associatedWith": "Jan 2017 - Present"
   },
   {
    "title": "BeeSting",
    "description": "BeeSting is a Data-Analyzing tool which monitors agent activity in the Avaya Call System environment. BeeSting, built from the ground-up in Visual Basic .NET and C++ .NET allows for quicker-response time in the Work-Force Management field. This tool also keeps record of agent acitivties, and reports a series of data to optimize call-center work-flow.\n\n[Monitor]\n* Break Overages\n* Lunch Overages\n* Customer Hold Overages\n* Slippage / Agent Utilization\n\n[Expenses]\n* Monitor loss of income due to agent activities.",
    "dateRange": {},
    "associatedWith": "Jul 2014 - Present"
